Muse Glimmer [https://ollama.com/library/muse-glimmer], Meta's newest open=
 model and the first released by Meta Superintelligence
Labs, is now available on Ollama. Muse Glimmer is a 30B multimodal model =
built for agent workloads that run locally.
=C2=A0

Download model [https://ollama.com/library/muse-glimmer]

=C2=A0
With Ollama, you can use Muse Glimmer to power coding agent applications =
such as Claude Code, Codex, Pi and more, as well as
long-running personal assistants such as OpenClaw and Hermes.
=C2=A0
To download and run Muse Glimmer locally, first download Ollama =
[https://ollama.com/download], then run:
=C2=A0

ollama run muse-glimmer

=C2=A0
Ollama's MLX engine provides state-of-the-art performance on Apple =
Silicon, with support for DFlash and image input:
=C2=A0

ollama run muse-glimmer:30b-mlx


=C2=A0


Power coding agents locally

To run Muse Glimmer with Claude Code, run:
=C2=A0

ollama launch claude =
--model muse-glimmer

=C2=A0
For a lighter-weight coding agent, try Pi =
[https://pi.dev]:
=C2=A0

ollama launch pi --model muse-glimmer

=C2=A0
For personal assistant frameworks such as OpenClaw and Hermes, use:
=C2=A0

ollama launch openclaw --model muse-glimmer

=C2=A0

ollama launch hermes --model muse-glimmer

=C2=A0
ollama launch also works =
with Codex, OpenCode, Copilot, and more. See all integrations [https://docs=
.ollama.com/integrations].
=C2=A0
Muse Glimmer also supports controllable =
reasoning strength: low, medium, high, and xhigh. Use high for complex =
coding and agentic
tasks, and lower strengths when speed matters more.
=C2=A0


State-of-the-art multimodal performance on Apple Silicon

=C2=A0
With Ollama 0.32.7, Ollama's MLX engine [https://ollama.=
com/blog/mlx-performance] now supports DFlash, building on previous
multi-token prediction (MTP) support [https://ollama.=
com/blog/faster-gemma-4-mlx-mtp] for 1.5-1.8x faster performance.
=C2=A0
With new image input support in the MLX engine, coding agents can now =
perform low-latency, back-to-back tool calling on tasks that
require images, such as:
 * Building websites or applications from a =
drawing or mockup

 * Computer use applications powered by screenshots

 * Reading documents, receipts, and charts

=C2=A0
If you have any feedback=
, reply directly to this email or join Ollama's Discord [https://discord.=
gg/ollama].
=C2=A0
=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F Ollama
=C2=A0
You are receiving this email because you opted in to receive updates from =
Ollama
